                "text": "CVE-2023-31484 in libperl5.36"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "CPAN.pm before 2.35 does not verify TLS certificates when downloading distributions over HTTPS."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2023-31484",
