              "id": "CVE-2026-9080",
              "name": "CVE-2026-9080",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-9080 in curl"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Calling `curl_easy_pause()` within the event-based `CURLMOPT_SOCKETFUNCTION`\ncallback triggers a use-after-free vulnerability, where libcurl attempts to\nstore a flag using a dangling struct pointer immediately after that pointer's\nmemory has been freed."
