              "id": "CVE-2026-27489",
              "name": "CVE-2026-27489",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-27489 in onnx"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Open Neural Network Exchange (ONNX) is an open standard for machine learning interoperability. Prior to version 1.21.0, a path traversal vulnerability via symlink allows to read arbitrary files outside model or user-provided directory. This issue has been patched in version 1.21.0."
              },
