                "text": "CVE-2025-56226 in libsndfile1"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Libsndfile <=1.2.2 contains a memory leak vulnerability in the mpeg_l3_encoder_init() function within the mpeg_l3_encode.c file."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-56226",
